# NAME: Google-AI
# DESC: Google/DeepMind AI product domains routed with the US-only AI policy
# UPDATED: 2026-09-14
# TYPE: Surge RULE-SET (Shadowrocket compatible)
# NOTE: Gemini and AI Studio are geo-gated and refuse unsupported regions, so
# these ride the AI group (one pinned US egress IP) rather than CF Edge Auto,
# whose Cloudflare Worker exits change country as the url-test picks a new PoP.
# The profiles must match this set before their inline `google.com` rule.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
